"Soporte para aplicaciones de IA","Flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["Configuration de Gauntlet pour les Outils d''IA","Développement piloté par OpenSpec","Intégration avec Flokay","Prise en charge des applications d''IA","Flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["Konfiguration von Gauntlet für KI-Agents","Entwicklung mit OpenSpec","Integration mit Flokay","Unterstützung für KI-Anwendungen","Flexibilität und Anpassung"],"pt":["Habilidades de agente para desenvolvimento","Esquema OpenSpec para especificações","Integração com o plugin Claude","Desenvolvimento orientado a especificações","Ferramentas de agente de IA para melhor eficiência"],"ru":["Навыки агента для разработки","Схема OpenSpec для спецификаций","Интеграция с плагином Claude","Разработка, ориентированная на спецификации","ИИ Агенты для повышения эффективности"],"ar":["مهارات وكلاء للتنمية","مخطط مواصفات مفتوحة للتفاصيل","التكامل مع مكون إضافي كلود","التنمية الموجهة بالمواصفات","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理工具","Flokay Gauntlet Setup","Agent Skills","OpenSpec 模式","Claude 插件","AI开发框架","如何使用 Flokay","Flokay 与其他工具的比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Flokay Gauntlet Setup","Agent Skills","OpenSpec 構造","Claude プラグイン","AI開発フレームワーク","Flokay の使い方","Flokay と他のツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Flokay Gauntlet Setup","Agent Skills","OpenSpec 구조","Claude 플러그인","AI 개발 프레임워크","Flokay 사용법","Flokay와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["cómo configurar Gauntlet","Agentes de IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA","Flokay","OpenSpec","configuración de Gauntlet","Guía de instalación de Gauntlet","Alternativas a Gauntlet"],"fr":["comment configurer Gauntlet","Outils d''IA","développement d''applications d''IA","Flokay","OpenSpec","configuration de Gauntlet","Guide d''installation de Gauntlet","Alternatives à Gauntlet"],"de":["Gauntlet konfigurieren","KI-Agents","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen","Flokay","OpenSpec","Gauntlet-Konfiguration","Installationsanleitung für Gauntlet","Alternativen zu Gauntlet"],"pt":["como usar Flokay","o que é agente de IA","Flokay vs outros plugins","guia de instalação do Flokay","desenvolvimento com habilidades de agente","especificações com OpenSpec","Flokay para iniciantes","melhores práticas para Flokay"],"ru":["как использовать Flokay","что такое ИИ Агент","Flokay vs другие плагины","руководство по установке Flokay","разработка с навыками агента","спецификации с OpenSpec","Flokay для начинающих","лучшие практики для Flokay"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام فلوكاي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","فلوكاي مقابل مكونات إضافية أخرى","دليل تثبيت فلوكاي","التنمية باستخدام مهارات الوكيل","المواصفات مع مخطط مواصفات مفتوحة","فلوكاي للمبتدئين","أفضل الممارسات لفلوكاي"]}},"owner":"pacaplan","repo":"flokay","repoPath":"pacaplan/flokay","stars":6,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T23:46:38Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gauntlet-setup","description":"Scan project and configure checks and reviews","bodyPreview":"# /gauntlet-setup\n\nScan the project to discover tooling and configure checks and reviews for agent-gauntlet.\n\nBefore starting, read `references/check-catalog.md` for check category details, YAML schemas, and example configurations.\n\n## Step 1: Check config exists\n\nRead `.gauntlet/config.yml`. If the file does not exist, tell the user to run `agent-gauntlet init` first and **STOP** — do not proceed with any further steps.\n\n## Step 2: Check existing config\n\nRead the `entry_points` field from `.gau","body":"# /gauntlet-setup\n\nScan the project to discover tooling and configure checks and reviews for agent-gauntlet.\n\nBefore starting, read `references/check-catalog.md` for check category details, YAML schemas, and example configurations.\n\n## Step 1: Check config exists\n\nRead `.gauntlet/config.yml`. If the file does not exist, tell the user to run `agent-gauntlet init` first and **STOP** — do not proceed with any further steps.\n\n## Step 2: Check existing config\n\nRead the `entry_points` field from `.gauntlet/config.yml`.\n\n**If `entry_points` is empty (`[]`):** This is a fresh setup. Proceed to Step 3 (detect project structure).\n\n**If `entry_points` is populated:** Show the user a summary of the current configuration:\n- List each entry point with its `path`, `checks`, and `reviews`\n- Then ask the user which action to take:\n\n  1. **Add checks** — Scan for tools not already configured. Proceed to Step 3, but filter out any checks that already appear in `entry_points`.\n  2. **Add custom** — User describes what they want to add. Skip to Step 7.\n  3. **Reconfigure** — Start fresh. Back up existing files first:\n     - Rename each `.gauntlet/checks/*.yml` file to `.yml.bak` (overwrite any previous `.bak` files)\n     - Rename each custom `.gauntlet/reviews/*.md` file to `.md.bak` (overwrite any previous `.bak` files)\n     - Do NOT rename `.gauntlet/reviews/*.yml` files (these are built-in review configs)\n     - Clear `entry_points` to `[]` in `config.yml`\n     - Proceed to Step 3\n\n## Step 3: Detect project structure\n\nScan for signals to classify the project as **monorepo**, **split project**, or **single project**.\n\n### Monorepo signals\n\n- `package.json` with a `workspaces` field\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`\n- `lerna.json`, `nx.json`, `turbo.json`\n- `Cargo.toml` with a `[workspace]` section\n- Multiple subdirectories under `packages/`, `apps/`, or `services/` each containing their own project manifest (`package.json`, `go.mod`, `Cargo.toml`, `pyproject.toml`)\n\n### Split project signals\n\n- `frontend/` + `backend/` (or `client/` + `server/`, `web/` + `api/`) directories each containing source code and/or their own project manifest\n- Multiple apps or libraries of the same language under a common parent directory (e.g., `apps/web/`, `apps/api/`, `apps/worker/` each with their own source and config) — suggests a wildcard entry point like `apps/*`\n\n### Single project signals\n\n- `src/` or `lib/` as sole source directory, or source files at project root\n- No monorepo or split project signals found\n\n**If monorepo or split project:** Read `references/project-structure.md` for detailed multi-project entry point guidance, then follow it for Steps 4 through 8. The rest of this file covers the single-project flow.\n\n**If single project:** Tell the user what you detected and continue below.\n\n## Step 4: Determine entry point path\n\nInfer the source directory:\n- If `src/` exists and contains source code, suggest `src`\n- If `lib/` exists and contains source code, suggest `lib`\n- Otherwise suggest `.` (project root — safer default since it captures all changes)\n\n**Skip this step** if adding checks to an existing entry point that already has a path.\n\n## Step 5: Scan for tooling\n\nScan the project for tooling signals across the 6 check categories listed in `references/check-catalog.md`.\n\n**For the \"add checks\" path:** Filter out checks already configured in `entry_points`.\n\n**If no tools discovered:** Offer the custom flow (skip to Step 7). Still include `code-quality` review.\n\n## Step 6: Present findings and confirm\n\nShow a table of discovered checks:\n\n```\nCategory        | Tool            | Command                              | Confidence\n----------------|-----------------|--------------------------------------|-----------\nBuild           | npm             | npm run build                        | High\nLint            | ESLint          | npx eslint .                         | High\nTypecheck       | TypeScript      | npx tsc --noEmit                     | High\nTest            | Jest            | npx jest                             | High\nSecurity (deps) | npm audit       | npm audit --audit-level=moderate     | Medium\nSecurity (code) | Semgrep         | semgrep scan --config auto --error . | Medium\n```\n\n**Confidence levels:**\n- **High** — Tool config file found AND/OR explicit script in package.json/Makefile\n- **Medium** — Tool found in devDependencies or inferred from CI workflow but no dedicated config\n- **Low** — Only indirect evidence (e.g., test directory exists but no runner config found)\n\nIf a category has no discovered tool, show `(not found)` with `—` for command and confidence.\n\nAsk the user:\n1. Which checks to enable (default: all)\n2. Whether any commands need adjustment\n\nIf the user declines ALL checks, still include `code-quality` review and offer the custom flow (Step 7).\n\nAfter confirmation, proceed to Step 8 (create files).\n\n## Step 7: Add custom\n\nAsk the user: **check** (shell command) or **review** (AI code review)?\n\n**For checks:** Ask for command, name, and optional settings (timeout, parallel, run_in_ci, run_locally).\n\n**For reviews:** Built-in (`code-quality`) or custom prompt? Ask for name and write the review content.\n\n## Step 8: Create files and update config\n\n**Checks** — Create `.gauntlet/checks/<name>.yml` with `command`, `parallel: true`, `run_in_ci: true`, `run_locally: true`. Add optional fields only when specified. See `references/check-catalog.md` for schema.\n\n**Custom reviews** — Create `.gauntlet/reviews/<name>.md` with YAML frontmatter (`num_reviews: 1`) and review prompt.\n\n**Built-in reviews** — Create `.gauntlet/reviews/<name>.yml` with `builtin: code-quality` and `num_reviews: 1`.\n\n**Update entry_points** in `.gauntlet/config.yml`:\n\n```yaml\nentry_points:\n  - path: \"<source_dir>\"\n    checks:\n      - <check-name-1>\n      - <check-name-2>\n    reviews:\n      - code-quality\n```\n\nAlways include `code-quality` in `reviews` for fresh setups. For \"add checks\" / \"add custom\": append to the appropriate entry point''s lists, or add a new entry point if needed.\n\n## Step 9: \"Add something else?\"\n\nAsk the user. If yes, loop to Step 7. If no, proceed.\n\n## Step 10: Validate\n\nRun `agent-gauntlet validate`. If it fails, apply one corrective attempt and re-validate. If it still fails, **STOP** and ask the user.\n\n## Step 11: Commit configuration\n\nCommit all gauntlet configuration and skills so the setup is preserved in version control:\n\n1. Stage all new/modified files: `.gauntlet/`, `.claude/skills/gauntlet-*/`, `.claude/settings.local.json`, `.gitignore`\n2. Create a commit: `git commit -m \"chore: configure agent-gauntlet checks and reviews\"`\n\nIf there are no changes to commit (everything already committed), skip this step silently.\n\n## Step 12: Suggest next steps\n\nTell the user: configuration is complete. Run `/gauntlet-run` to execute, or `/gauntlet-setup` again to add more.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T01:56:01.223Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated project setup and configuration for agent-gauntlet.","zh":"适合需要自动化项目设置和配置的开发代理，特别是agent-gauntlet","ja":"開発エージェントが自動化されたプロジェクト設定と構成が必要な場合、特にagent-gauntletに適しています","ko":"agent-gauntlet의 자동화된 프로젝트 설정 및 구성이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una configuración y configuración de proyecto automatizada para agent-gauntlet.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''une configuration et d''une configuration de projet automatisées pour agent-gauntlet.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Projektsetup- und Konfiguration für agent-gauntlet benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de configuração e instalação automatizada de projetos para agent-gauntlet.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматическая настройка и конфигурация проектов для agent-gauntlet.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى إعداد وتكوين مشروع آلي لبرنامج agent-gauntlet."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure checks and reviews for agent-gauntlet by scanning project tooling and utilizing YAML schemas, providing a robust spec-driven development experience with OpenSpec schema and Claude plugin integration.","zh":"使得代理能够通过扫描项目工具并利用YAML模式来配置检查和审查，提供使用OpenSpec模式和Claude插件集成的强大规格驱动开发体验","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクトツールをスキャンし、YAMLスキーマを利用してチェックとレビューを構成できるようにし、OpenSpecスキーマとClaudeプラグインの統合を使用した堅牢な仕様駆動開発体験を提供します","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 툴을 스캔하고 YAML 스키마를 활용하여 체크와 리뷰를 구성할 수 있으며, OpenSpec 스키마와 Claude 플러그인 통합을 사용한 강력한 사양 구동 개발 경험을 제공합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar controles y revisiones para agent-gauntlet mediante el análisis de la instrumentación del proyecto y la utilización de esquemas YAML, proporcionando una experiencia de desarrollo basada en especificaciones robusta con el esquema OpenSpec y la integración del plugin Claude.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer des contrôles et des examens pour agent-gauntlet en analysant l''outillage du projet et en utilisant des schémas YAML, fournissant une expérience de développement basée sur des spécifications robuste avec le schéma OpenSpec et l''intégration du plugin Claude.","de":"Ermächtigt Mittel, Prüfungen und Überprüfungen für agent-gauntlet zu konfigurieren, indem es die Projekt-Tooling scannt und YAML-Schemata nutzt, wodurch ein robustes spezifikationsgetriebenes Entwicklungserlebnis mit OpenSpec-Schema und Claude-Plugin-Integration bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurarem verificações e revisões para agent-gauntlet, digitalizando a ferramenta de projeto e utilizando esquemas YAML, fornecendo uma experiência de desenvolvimento robusta e baseada em especificações com esquema OpenSpec e integração do plugin Claude.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конфигурировать проверки и обзоры для agent-gauntlet, сканируя инструментарий проекта и используя схемы YAML, обеспечивая прочный опыт разработки, основанный на спецификации, с использованием схемы OpenSpec и интеграции плагина Claude.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تكوين الفحوصات والمراجعات لبرنامج agent-gauntlet من خلال مسح أدوات المشروع واستخدام مخططات YAML، مما يوفر تجربة تطوير قوية وقائمة على مواصفات مع مخطط OpenSpec وتكامل إضافة Claude."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring project setup for agent-gauntlet","Automating check and review configurations","Validating YAML configurations against OpenSpec schema"],"zh":["为agent-gauntlet配置项目设置","自动化检查和审查配置","验证YAML配置是否符合OpenSpec模式"],"ja":["agent-gauntletのプロジェクト設定の構成","チェックとレビューの構成の自動化","YAML構成のOpenSpecスキーマへの準拠の検証"],"ko":["agent-gauntlet의 프로젝트 설정 구성","체크 및 리뷰 구성 자동화","YAML 구성의 OpenSpec 스키마 적합성 검증"],"es":["Configuración de la configuración del proyecto para agent-gauntlet","Automatización de la configuración de controles y revisiones","Validación de configuraciones YAML contra el esquema OpenSpec"],"fr":["Configuration de la configuration du projet pour agent-gauntlet","Automatisation de la configuration des contrôles et des examens","Validation des configurations YAML contre le schéma OpenSpec"],"de":["Konfiguration der Projektsetup für agent-gauntlet","Automatisierung der Konfiguration von Prüfungen und Überprüfungen","Validierung von YAML-Konfigurationen gegen das OpenSpec-Schema"],"pt":["Configurando a instalação do projeto para agent-gauntlet","Automatizando configurações de verificação e revisão","Validando configurações YAML contra o esquema OpenSpec"],"ru":["Настройка установки проекта для agent-gauntlet","Автоматизация конфигураций проверок и обзоров","Проверка конфигураций YAML против схемы OpenSpec"],"ar":["تكوين إعدادات مشروع برنامج agent-gauntlet","تأتميت إعدادات الفحص والمراجعة","التحقق من إعدادات YAML مقابل مخطط OpenSpec"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .gauntlet/config.yml file to exist","Needs agent-gauntlet init to be run first if config file does not exist","Specific to agent-gauntlet and Claude plugin ecosystem"],"zh":[".gauntlet/config.yml文件必须存在","如果配置文件不存在，需要先运行agent-gauntlet init","仅限agent-gauntlet和Claude插件生态系统"],"ja":[".gauntlet/config.ymlファイルが存在する必要がある","構成ファイルが存在しない場合、agent-gauntlet initを最初に実行する必要がある","agent-gauntletとClaudeプラグインのエコシステムに特有"],"ko":[".gauntlet/config.yml 파일이 존재해야 함","구성 파일이 존재하지 않는 경우, agent-gauntlet init을 먼저 실행해야 함","agent-gauntlet과 Claude 플러그인 에코시스템에 특정"],"es":["Requiere que exista el archivo .gauntlet/config.yml","Necesita que se ejecute agent-gauntlet init primero si no existe el archivo de configuración","Específico del ecosistema de agent-gauntlet y del plugin Claude"],"fr":["Nécessite l''existence du fichier .gauntlet/config.yml","Nécessite l''exécution de agent-gauntlet init en premier si le fichier de configuration n''existe pas","Spécifique à l''écosystème agent-gauntlet et au plugin Claude"],"de":["Benötigt die Existenz der Datei .gauntlet/config.yml","Benötigt die Ausführung von agent-gauntlet init zuerst, wenn die Konfigurationsdatei nicht existiert","Spezifisch für das Ökosystem von agent-gauntlet und dem Claude-Plugin"],"pt":["Exige a existência do arquivo .gauntlet/config.yml","Necessita que o agent-gauntlet init seja executado primeiro se o arquivo de configuração não existir","Específico para o ecossistema do agent-gauntlet e do plugin Claude"],"ru":["Требует существования файла .gauntlet/config.yml","Требует запуска agent-gauntlet init сначала, если файл конфигурации не существует","Конкретно для экосистемы agent-gauntlet и плагина Claude"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود ملف .gauntlet/config.yml","يحتاج إلى تشغيل agent-gauntlet init أولاً إذا لم يكن ملف التهيئة موجودا","محدد لنظام الإيكوسيستم لبرنامج agent-gauntlet وإضافة Claude"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0fba5e4b02acb307363cfb4142bf2afaccdd0f2133d83ec9593a4b016c5332ca","qualityScore":45}');
