rtunidades","Informes personalizados","Integración con herramientas de inversión","Actualizaciones en tiempo real"],"fr":["Analyse quotidienne de portefeuille automatisée","Mise en œuvre de la stratégie de portefeuille permanent de Harry Browne","Analyse des risques et des opportunités","Rapports personnalisés","Intégration avec des outils d''investissement","Mises à jour en temps réel"],"de":["Automatisierte tägliche Portfolioanalyse","Implementierung der Permanent-Portfolio-Strategie von Harry Browne","Risiko- und Chancenanalyse","Individuelle Berichte","Integration mit Anlage-Tools","Echtzeit-Aktualisierungen"],"pt":["Análise de carteira automatizada","Implementação da estratégia de Portfolio Permanente","Otimização de investimentos","Relatórios diários personalizados","Integração com ferramentas de investimento","Suporte a múltiplos ativos"],"ru":["Автоматический анализ портфеля","Реализация стратегии Постоянного Портфеля","Оптимизация инвестиций","Персонализированные ежедневные отчеты","Интеграция с инструментами инвестирования","Поддержка нескольких активов"],"ar":["تحليل تلقائي للمحفظة","تنفيذ استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة","تحسين الاستثمارات","تقارير يومية مخصصة","دمج مع أدوات الاستثمار","دعم متعدد الأصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","永久投资组合策略","如何使用deepwork_jobs","什么是Harry Browne永久投资组合策略","deepwork_jobs安装指南","deepwork_jobs vs 其他投资组合工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","永久ポートフォリオ戦略","deepwork_jobsの使い方","ハリー・ブラウンの永久ポートフォリオ戦略とは","deepwork_jobsのインストールガイド","deepwork_jobs vs その他のポートフォリオツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","영구 포트폴리오 전략","deepwork_jobs 사용법","Harry Browne의 영구 포트폴리오 전략이란","deepwork_jobs 설치 가이드","deepwork_jobs vs 다른 포트폴리오 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para inversores","análisis de cartera diario","estrategia de cartera permanente","Harry Browne","automatización de análisis de cartera","herramientas de inversión","guias de instalación de deepwork_jobs","configuración de deepwork_jobs","alternativas a deepwork_jobs"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour investisseurs","analyse quotidienne de portefeuille","stratégie de portefeuille permanent","Harry Browne","automatisation de l''analyse de portefeuille","outils d''investissement","guides d''installation de deepwork_jobs","configuration de deepwork_jobs","alternatives à deepwork_jobs"],"de":["KI-Tools für Anleger","tägliche Portfolioanalyse","Permanent-Portfolio-Strategie","Harry Browne","Automatisierung der Portfolioanalyse","Anlage-Tools","Installationsanleitungen für deepwork_jobs","Einrichtung von deepwork_jobs","Alternativen zu deepwork_jobs"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para investimentos","como usar deepwork_jobs","o que é portfolio permanente","deepwork_jobs alternativa","deepwork_jobs vs outras ferramentas","instalar deepwork_jobs","guia de configuração do deepwork_jobs"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для инвестирования","как использовать deepwork_jobs","что такое Постоянный Портфель","deepwork_jobs альтернатива","deepwork_jobs против других инструментов","установить deepwork_jobs","руководство по настройке deepwork_jobs"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للاستثمار","كيفية استخدام deepwork_jobs","ما هي المحفظة الدائمة","بديل deepwork_jobs","deepwork_jobs مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت deepwork_jobs","دليل إعداد deepwork_jobs"]}},"owner":"ncrmro","repo":"deepwork-permanent-portfolio","repoPath":"ncrmro/deepwork-permanent-portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:20:06.220Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deepwork_jobs","description":"Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.","bodyPreview":"# deepwork_jobs\n\n**Multi-step workflow**: Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.\n\n> **CRITICAL**: Always invoke steps using the Skill tool. Never copy/paste step instructions directly.\n\nCore commands for managing DeepWork jobs. These commands help you define new multi-step\nworkflows and learn from running them.\n\nThe `define` command guides you through an interactive process to create a new job by\nasking structured questions about","body":"# deepwork_jobs\n\n**Multi-step workflow**: Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.\n\n> **CRITICAL**: Always invoke steps using the Skill tool. Never copy/paste step instructions directly.\n\nCore commands for managing DeepWork jobs. These commands help you define new multi-step\nworkflows and learn from running them.\n\nThe `define` command guides you through an interactive process to create a new job by\nasking structured questions about your workflow, understanding each step''s inputs and outputs,\nand generating all necessary files.\n\nThe `learn` command reflects on conversations where DeepWork jobs were run, identifies\nconfusion or inefficiencies, and improves job instructions. It also captures bespoke\nlearnings specific to the current run into AGENTS.md files in the working folder.\n\n\n## Available Steps\n\n1. **define** - Creates a job.yml specification by gathering workflow requirements through structured questions. Use when starting a new multi-step workflow.\n2. **review_job_spec** - Reviews job.yml against quality criteria using a sub-agent for unbiased validation. Use after defining a job specification. (requires: define)\n3. **implement** - Generates step instruction files and syncs slash commands from the job.yml specification. Use after job spec review passes. (requires: review_job_spec)\n4. **learn** - Analyzes conversation history to improve job instructions and capture learnings. Use after running a job to refine it.\n\n## Execution Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Intent\n\nParse any text following `/deepwork_jobs` to determine user intent:\n- \"define\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.define`\n- \"review_job_spec\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.review_job_spec`\n- \"implement\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.implement`\n- \"learn\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.learn`\n\n### Step 2: Invoke Starting Step\n\nUse the Skill tool to invoke the identified starting step:\n```\nSkill tool: deepwork_jobs.define\n```\n\n### Step 3: Continue Workflow Automatically\n\nAfter each step completes:\n1. Check if there''s a next step in the sequence\n2. Invoke the next step using the Skill tool\n3. Repeat until workflow is complete or user intervenes\n\n### Handling Ambiguous Intent\n\nIf user intent is unclear, use AskUserQuestion to clarify:\n- Present available steps as numbered options\n- Let user select the starting point\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Do NOT copy/paste step instructions directly; always use the Skill tool to invoke steps\n- Do NOT skip steps in the workflow unless the user explicitly requests it\n- Do NOT proceed to the next step if the current step''s outputs are incomplete\n- Do NOT make assumptions about user intent; ask for clarification when ambiguous\n\n## Context Files\n\n- Job definition: `.deepwork/jobs/deepwork_jobs/job.yml`"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T07:23:04.142Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automated Portfolio Analysis Agents needing advanced multi-step workflow management and Harry Browne''s Permanent Portfolio strategy implementation.","zh":"适合需要高级多步骤工作流管理和哈里·布朗永久投资组合策略实现的自动化投资组合分析代理。","ja":"高度なマルチステップワークフローマネジメントとハリー・ブラウンの永久ポートフォリオ戦略の実装が必要な自動化ポートフォリオ分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 多단계 워크플로우 관리와 해리 브라운의 영구 포트폴리오 전략 구현이 필요한 자동화된 포트폴리오 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Cartera Automatizados que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo avanzada de varios pasos y la implementación de la estrategia de Cartera Permanente de Harry Browne.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de portefeuille automatisés ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow avancée à plusieurs étapes et de la mise en œuvre de la stratégie de portefeuille permanent de Harry Browne.","de":"Ideal für automatisierte Portfolioanalyse-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Verwaltung von Arbeitsabläufen mit mehreren Schritten und die Implementierung der Permanent Portfolio-Strategie von Harry Browne benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Carteira Automatizada que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho avançado em várias etapas e implementação da estratégia de Carteira Permanente de Harry Browne.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматического анализа портфеля, которым необходим продвинутый менеджмент рабочих процессов с несколькими шагами и реализация стратегии Постоянного портфеля Гарри Брауна.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل المحفظة الآلي الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة سير عمل متقدم متعددة الخطوات وتنفيذ استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة لهاري براون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage complex workflows using multi-step processes, defining new jobs through interactive structured questions and implementing automated daily portfolio analysis using protocols like Permanent Portfolio strategy, thereby enhancing their workflow automation capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理复杂工作流的能力，使用多步骤的过程，通过交互式结构化问题定义新的作业，并使用永久投资组合策略等协议实施自动化的每日投资组合分析，从而增强其工作流自动化能力。","ja":"エージェントに複雑なワークフローを作成および管理する能力を与え、多ステップのプロセスを使用し、インタラクティブな構造化された質問を通じて新しいジョブを定義し、永久ポートフォリオ戦略などのプロトコルを使用して自動化された毎日のポートフォリオ分析を実装することで、ワークフローの自動化能力を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 워크플로우를 생성하고 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 다단계 프로세스를 사용하고 상호 작용 구조화된 질문을 통해 새로운 작업을 정의하며 영구 포트폴리오 전략과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 자동화된 일일 포트폴리오 분석을 구현하여 워크플로우 자동화 기능을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar flujos de trabajo complejos usando procesos de varios pasos, definiendo nuevos trabajos a través de preguntas interactivas estructuradas e implementando un análisis de cartera automatizado diario utilizando protocolos como la estrategia de Cartera Permanente, mejorando así sus capacidades de automatización de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des flux de travail complexes en utilisant des processus à plusieurs étapes, en définissant de nouveaux travaux via des questions structurées interactives et en mettant en œuvre une analyse de portefeuille automatisée quotidienne en utilisant des protocoles tels que la stratégie de portefeuille permanent, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités d''automatisation de flux de travail.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Arbeitsabläufe zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie mehrstufige Prozesse verwenden, neue Aufgaben durch interaktive strukturierte Fragen definieren und eine automatisierte tägliche Portfolioanalyse mithilfe von Protokollen wie der Permanent Portfolio-Strategie implementieren, wodurch ihre Arbeitsablaufautomatisierungsfähigkeiten verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar fluxos de trabalho complexos usando processos em várias etapas, definindo novos trabalhos por meio de perguntas interativas estruturadas e implementando análise de carteira automatizada diária usando protocolos como a estratégia de Carteira Permanente, melhorando assim suas capacidades de automação de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять сложными рабочими процессами с помощью многоступенчатых процессов, определять новые задания посредством интерактивных структурированных вопросов и реализовывать автоматический ежедневный анализ портфеля с помощью протоколов типа стратегии Постоянного портфеля, тем самым повышая их возможности автоматизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء وإدارة سير عمل معقدة باستخدام عمليات متعددة الخطوات، وتحديد مهام جديدة من خلال أسئلة متفاعلة منظمة وتنفيذ تحليل المحفظة الآلي اليومي باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة، وبالتالي تعزيز قدراتهم على автоматизация سير العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily portfolio analysis","Defining new multi-step workflows","Implementing Harry Browne''s Permanent Portfolio strategy","Managing and improving existing DeepWork jobs"],"zh":["自动化每日投资组合分析","定义新的多步骤工作流","实施哈里·布朗的永久投资组合策略","管理和改进现有的DeepWork作业"],"ja":["毎日のポートフォリオ分析の自動化","新しいマルチステップワークフローの定義","ハリー・ブラウンの永久ポートフォリオ戦略の実装","既存のDeepWorkジョブの管理と改善"],"ko":["일일 포트폴리오 분석의 자동화","新的 다단계 워크플로우의 정의","해리 브라운의 영구 포트폴리오 전략의 구현","기존의 DeepWork 작업의 관리 및 개선"],"es":["Automatización del análisis de cartera diario","Definición de nuevos flujos de trabajo de varios pasos","Implementación de la estrategia de Cartera Permanente de Harry Browne","Gestión y mejora de los trabajos de DeepWork existentes"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''analyse de portefeuille quotidienne","Définition de nouveaux flux de travail à plusieurs étapes","Mise en œuvre de la stratégie de portefeuille permanent de Harry Browne","Gestion et amélioration des travaux DeepWork existants"],"de":["Automatisierung der täglichen Portfolioanalyse","Definition neuer Arbeitsabläufe mit mehreren Schritten","Implementierung der Permanent Portfolio-Strategie von Harry Browne","Verwaltung und Verbesserung der bestehenden DeepWork-Aufgaben"],"pt":["Automatizar análise diária de carteira","Definir novos fluxos de trabalho em várias etapas","Implementar a estratégia de Carteira Permanente de Harry Browne","Gerenciar e melhorar trabalhos DeepWork existentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ежедневный анализ портфеля","Определить новые рабочие процессы с несколькими шагами","Реализовать стратегию Постоянного портфеля Гарри Брауна","Управлять и улучшать существующие задания DeepWork"],"ar":["تحليل المحفظة الآلي اليومي","تحديد سير عمل جديدة متعددة الخطوات","تنفيذ استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة لهاري براون","إدارة وتحسين مهام DeepWork الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires invocation through the Skill tool","No direct copy/paste of step instructions allowed"],"zh":["需要通过Skill工具调用","不允许直接复制/粘贴步骤说明"],"ja":["Skillツールを介した呼び出しが必要","ステップの指示の直接コピー/ペーストは許可されません"],"ko":["스킬 도구를 통해 호출해야 함","단계 지침의 직접 복사/붙여넣기가 허용되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere invocación a través de la herramienta Skill","No se permite la copia/pega directa de instrucciones de paso"],"fr":["Requiert une invocation via l''outil Skill","Pas de copie/collage direct de instructions d''étape autorisé"],"de":["Erfordert Aufruf über das Skill-Tool","Keine direkte Kopie/Einfügung von Schrittanweisungen erlaubt"],"pt":["Requer invocação através da ferramenta Skill","Não é permitida a cópia/colagem direta de instruções de etapa"],"ru":["Требует вызова через инструмент Skill","Не допускается прямая копия/вставка инструкций шага"],"ar":["يتطلب استدعاء من خلال أداة Skill","لا يسمح بنسخ/لصق مباشر لتعليمات الخطوة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"aecfdc18f3e7bc78dc1cb4b33115b970a1be6b403e7d2c507bd710abec3c1c9f","qualityScore":45}');
