base de conocimientos de GitHub es una herramienta para gestionar y buscar proyectos en un repositorio local","fr":"La base de connaissances GitHub est un outil pour gérer et rechercher des projets dans un référentiel local","de":"Die GitHub-Wissensbasis ist ein Tool zur Verwaltung und Suche von Projekten in einem lokalen Repository","pt":"O GitHub Knowledge Base é uma ferramenta para gerenciar conhecimento e realizar buscas no GitHub","ru":"База знаний GitHub - это инструмент для управления знаниями и поиска в GitHub","ar":"قاعدة معرفة جيثب هي أداة لإدارة المعرفة والبحث في جيثب","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"definition":{"en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"features":{"zh":["支持设置环境变量","使用 gh CLI 进行搜索","管理本地 GitHub 知识库","支持私有仓库","轻松搜索 GitHub 项目"],"ja":["環境変数の設定をサポート","gh CLI を使用して検索","ローカル GitHub ナレッジベースを管理","プライベートリポジトリをサポート","GitHub プロジェクトを簡単に検索"],"ko":["환경 변수 설정 지원","gh CLI를 사용하여 검색","로컬 GitHub 지식庫 관리","사립 저장소를 지원","GitHub 프로젝트를 쉽게 검색"],"es":["Gestión de un repositorio de conocimientos de GitHub local","Búsqueda de proyectos con gh CLI","Configuración de variables de entorno para el acceso a repositorios privados","Catalogación de proyectos con descripciones breves en GITHUB_KB.md","Personalización del camino del directorio de la base de conocimientos"],"fr":["Gestion d''une base de connaissances GitHub locale","Recherche de projets avec gh CLI","Configuration de variables d''environnement pour l''accès aux référentiels privés","Catalogage de projets avec des descriptions brèves dans GITHUB_KB.md","Personnalisation du chemin du répertoire de la base de connaissances"],"de":["Verwaltung eines lokalen GitHub-Wissensrepositories","Suche von Projekten mit gh CLI","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen für den Zugriff auf private Repositorys","Katalogisierung von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen in GITHUB_KB.md","Anpassung des Pfads des Wissensrepository-Verzeichnisses"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de base de conhecimento local","Busca via CLI do GitHub","Suporte a repositórios privados","Configuração de variáveis de ambiente","Catalogação de projetos com descrições breves"],"ru":["Управление локальной базой знаний","Поиск через CLI GitHub","Поддержка приватных репозиториев","Настройка переменных среды","Каталогизация проектов с краткими описаниями"],"ar":["إدارة قاعدة معرفة محلية","البحث من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر لجيثب","دعم للمستودعات الخاصة","تكوين متغيرات البيئة","فهرسة المشاريع مع описات موجزة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub 知识库管理","GitHub 项目管理","gh CLI","环境变量设置","私有仓库管理","GitHub 搜索"],"ja":["GitHub ナレッジベース管理","GitHub プロジェクト管理","gh CLI","環境変数設定","プライベートリポジトリ管理","GitHub 検索"],"ko":["GitHub 지식庫 관리","GitHub 프로젝트 관리","gh CLI","환경 변수 설정","사립 저장소 관리","GitHub 검색"],"es":["github knowledge base","gestión de conocimientos","búsqueda de proyectos","gh cli","repositorio local","variables de entorno","acceso a repositorios privados"],"fr":["base de connaissances github","gestion des connaissances","recherche de projets","gh cli","référentiel local","variables d''environnement","accès aux référentiels privés"],"de":["github-wissensbasis","wissensmanagement","suche von projekten","gh cli","lokales repository","umgebungsvariablen","zugriff auf private repositorys"],"pt":["github knowledge base","gerenciamento de conhecimento","busca no github","cli do github","repositórios privados","variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["база знаний github","управление знаниями","поиск в github","cli github","приватные репозитории","переменные среды"],"ar":["قاعدة معرفة جيثب","إدارة المعرفة","البحث في جيثب","واجهة سطر الأوامر لجيثب","المستودعات الخاصة","متغيرات البيئة"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.571Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-kb","description":"Manage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Use when users ask about repos, PRs, issues, request to clone GitHub repositories, explore codebases, or need information about GitHub projects. Supports searching GitHub via gh CLI and managing local KB with GITHUB_KB.md catalog. Configure via GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH environment variables.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GIT","body":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GITHUB_KB_PATH=\"/your/path/github-kb\"\n```\n\n**Token Privacy:** Never hardcode tokens. Inject via environment variables or container secrets.\n\n## GitHub CLI (gh)\n\n**Requirement:** GitHub CLI must be installed and authenticated.\n\n**Installation:**\n- **macOS:** `brew install gh`\n- **Linux:** `apt install gh` or see [official install guide](https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/docs/install_linux.md)\n- **Windows:** `winget install GitHub.cli`\n\n**Authentication:**\n```bash\n# Interactive login\ngh auth login\n\n# Or use token from GITHUB_TOKEN env var\ngh auth login --with-token <(echo \"$GITHUB_TOKEN\")\n```\n\n**Verify:** `gh auth status`\n\nIf `gh` is not installed or not authenticated, skip search operations and use only local KB features.\n\n### Searching Repos\n\n```bash\n# Search repos by keyword\ngh search repos <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search repos \"typescript cli\" --limit 10\ngh search repos \"language:python stars:>1000\" --limit 20\ngh search repos \"topic:mcp\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by programming language\n- `stars:<n>` or `stars:><n>` - Filter by star count\n- `topic:<name>` - Filter by topic\n- `user:<owner>` - Search within a user''s repos\n- `org:<org>` - Search within an organization\n\n### Searching Issues\n\n```bash\ngh search issues \"react hooks bug\" --limit 20\ngh search issues \"repo:facebook/react state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search issues \"language:typescript label:bug\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed` - Filter by issue state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `comments:<n>` or `comments:><n>` - Filter by comment count\n\n### Searching Pull Requests\n\n```bash\n# Search PRs\ngh search prs <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search prs \"repo:vercel/next.js state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search prs \"language:go is:merged\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed|merged` - Filter by PR state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `is:merged|unmerged` - Filter by merge status\n\n### Viewing PR/Issue Details\n\n```bash\n# View issue/PR details\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\n\n# View with comments\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\n```\n\n## Local Knowledge Base Workflow\n\n### Querying About a Repo in KB\n\n1. Read GITHUB_KB.md to understand what projects exist\n2. Locate the project directory under ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/\n\n### Cloning a New Repo to KB\n\n1. Search GitHub if the full repo name is not known\n2. Clone to KB directory:\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<name>.git ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/<name>\n   ```\n3. Generate project description: Read README or key files to understand the project\n4. Update GITHUB_KB.md: Add entry for the new repo following the existing format:\n   ```markdown\n   ### [<name>](/<name>)\n   Brief one-line description of what the project does. Additional context if useful (key features, tech stack, etc.).\n   ```\n5. Confirm completion: Tell user the repo was cloned and where to find it\n\n### Default Clone Location\n\nIf user says \"clone X\" without specifying a directory, default to ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/.\n\n## GITHUB_KB.md Format\n\nThe catalog file follows this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nThis directory contains X GitHub projects covering various domains.\n\n---\n\n## Category Name\n\n### [project-name](/project-name)\nBrief description of the project.\n```\n\nMaintain categorization and consistent formatting when updating.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:23:00.870Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing unified access to GitHub repositories and knowledge bases via the gh CLI.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 gh CLI 统一访问 GitHub 仓库和知识库的 AI 代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリとナレッジベースへの統一されたアクセスが必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 저장소 및 지식 베이스에 대한統一された 액세스가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan acceso unificado a los repositorios de GitHub y bases de conocimiento a través de la CLI de gh.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''un accès unifié aux référentiels GitHub et aux bases de connaissances via la CLI gh.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die einen einheitlichen Zugriff auf GitHub-Repositorys und Wissensbasen über die gh-CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de acesso unificado a repositórios e bases de conhecimento do GitHub via a CLI do gh.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется единый доступ к репозиториям и базам знаний GitHub через CLI gh.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى الوصول الموحد إلى مستودعات GitHub وقواعد المعرفة عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر gh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage a local GitHub knowledge base, providing GitHub search capabilities and cataloging projects with brief descriptions using environment variables like GITHUB_TOKEN for private repository access.","zh":"赋予代理管理本地 GitHub 知识库的能力，提供 GitHub 搜索功能，并使用环境变量（如 GITHUB_TOKEN）对项目进行编目和简要描述，以实现对私有仓库的访问。","ja":"エージェントにローカルな GitHub ナレッジベースを管理する能力を与え、GitHub 検索機能を提供し、環境変数（例：GITHUB_TOKEN）を使用してプロジェクトをカタログ化し、プライベート リポジトリにアクセスします。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 GitHub 지식베이스를 관리할 수 있도록 하며 GitHub 검색 기능을 제공하고 환경 변수(GITHUB_TOKEN 등)를 사용하여 프로젝트를 카탈로그화하고、私有 저장소에 액세스할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes administrar una base de conocimiento de GitHub local, proporcionando capacidades de búsqueda de GitHub y catalogación de proyectos con descripciones breves utilizando variables de entorno como GITHUB_TOKEN para el acceso a repositorios privados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer une base de connaissances GitHub locale, en fournissant des capacités de recherche GitHub et en cataloguant les projets avec des descriptions brèves en utilisant des variables d''environnement comme GITHUB_TOKEN pour l''accès aux référentiels privés.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, eine lokale GitHub-Wissensbasis zu verwalten, indem es GitHub-Suchfunktionen und die Katalogisierung von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen unter Verwendung von Umgebungsvariablen wie GITHUB_TOKEN für den Zugriff auf private Repositorys bereitstellt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar uma base de conhecimento local do GitHub, fornecendo capacidades de pesquisa do GitHub e catalogação de projetos com descrições breves usando variáveis de ambiente como GITHUB_TOKEN para acesso a repositórios privados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять локальной базой знаний GitHub, обеспечивая возможности поиска GitHub и каталогизации проектов с краткими описаниями с использованием переменных среды, таких как GITHUB_TOKEN, для доступа к частным репозиториям.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة قاعدة معرفة محلية لجيت هاب، وتوفير قدرات البحث في جيت هاب وتسجيل المشاريع مع описات موجزة باستخدام متغيرات بيئية مثل GITHUB_TOKEN للوصول إلى المستودعات الخاصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Cataloging projects with brief descriptions in GITHUB_KB.md","Searching GitHub repositories via gh CLI","Managing local knowledge base directories with GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"zh":["在 GITHUB_KB.md 中对项目进行编目和简要描述","通过 gh CLI 搜索 GitHub 仓库","使用 GITHUB_KB_PATH 管理本地知识库目录"],"ja":["GITHUB_KB.md にプロジェクトをカタログ化し簡単な説明を追加する","gh CLI経由で GitHub リポジトリを検索する","GITHUB_KB_PATH を使用してローカルナレッジベース ディレクトリを管理する"],"ko":["GITHUB_KB.md에 프로젝트를 카탈로그화하고 간단한 설명을 추가하는 것","gh CLI를 통해 GitHub 저장소를 검색하는 것","GITHUB_KB_PATH를 사용하여 로컬 지식베이스 디렉토리를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Catalogación de proyectos con descripciones breves en GITHUB_KB.md","Búsqueda de repositorios de GitHub a través de la CLI de gh","Administración de directorios de la base de conocimiento local con GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"fr":["Catalogage de projets avec des descriptions brèves dans GITHUB_KB.md","Recherche de référentiels GitHub via la CLI gh","Gestion des répertoires de la base de connaissances locale avec GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"de":["Katalogisierung von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen in GITHUB_KB.md","Suche von GitHub-Repositorys über die gh-CLI","Verwaltung von lokalen Wissensbasisverzeichnissen mit GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"pt":["Catalogação de projetos com descrições breves em GITHUB_KB.md","Pesquisa de repositórios do GitHub via CLI do gh","Gerenciamento de diretórios de base de conhecimento local com GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ru":["Каталогизация проектов с краткими описаниями в GITHUB_KB.md","Поиск репозиториев GitHub через CLI gh","Управление локальными каталогами базы знаний с помощью GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ar":["تسجيل المشاريع مع описات موجزة في GITHUB_KB.md","البحث في مستودعات جيت هاب عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","إدارة دليل قاعدة المعرفة المحلية مع GITHUB_KB_PATH"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Personal Access Token for private repositories","Needs environment variables set for GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 个人访问令牌来访问私有仓库","需要设置 GITHUB_TOKEN 和 GITHUB_KB_PATH 等环境变量"],"ja":["プライベート リポジトリにアクセスするために GitHub パーソナル アクセス トークンが必要","GITHUB_TOKEN および GITHUB_KB_PATH などの環境変数を設定する必要がある"],"ko":["개인 저장소에 액세스하기 위해 GitHub 개인 액세스 토큰이 필요함","GITHUB_TOKEN 및 GITHUB_KB_PATH 등의 환경 변수를 설정해야 함"],"es":["Requiere un token de acceso personal de GitHub para los repositorios privados","Necesita variables de entorno configuradas para GITHUB_TOKEN y GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''accès personnel GitHub pour les référentiels privés","Nécessite des variables d''environnement configurées pour GITHUB_TOKEN et GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"de":["Benötigt ein GitHub-Personal-Zugriffstoken für private Repositorys","Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen, die für GITHUB_TOKEN und GITHUB_KB_PATH konfiguriert sind"],"pt":["Requer Token de Acesso Pessoal do GitHub para repositórios privados","Necessita de variáveis de ambiente configuradas para GITHUB_TOKEN e GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ru":["Требует личного токена доступа GitHub для частных репозиториев","Требует настройки переменных среды для GITHUB_TOKEN и GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز الوصول الشخصي لجيت هاب للمستودعات الخاصة","يحتاج إلى تعيين متغيرات البيئة ل GITHUB_TOKEN و GITHUB_KB_PATH"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8d62830e2d00b0b63fe36620febd451b583dbcfad38acf354a1d77942401e303","qualityScore":45}');
