 처리하는 기본 작업을 다룹니다","es":"Guía para procesar PDF con Python, incluyendo operaciones básicas y avanzadas para desarrolladores","fr":"Guide pour traiter les PDF avec Python, incluant des opérations de base et avancées pour les développeurs","de":"Anleitung zur Verarbeitung von PDF mit Python, einschließlich grundlegender und erweiterter Operationen für Entwickler","pt":"Esta guia aborda operações essenciais de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python. Veja exemplos e recursos para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Это руководство охватывает основные операции обработки PDF с помощью библиотек Python. Примеры и ресурсы для разработчиков.","ar":"يهتم هذا الدليل بالعمليات الأساسية لمعالجة المستندات بتنسيق بي دي إف باستخدام مكتبات بايثون. انظر الأمثلة والموارد للمطورين.","en":"Personal AI infrastructure built on Claude Code"},"definition":{"en":"Personal AI infrastructure built on Claude Code"},"features":{"zh":["使用Python库读取PDF文档","提取PDF文档中的文本","填写PDF表单","使用命令行工具执行PDF处理操作"],"ja":["Pythonライブラリを使用してPDFドキュメントを読み取り","PDFドキュメントからテキストを抽出","PDFフォームを埋める","コマンドラインツールを使用してPDF処理操作を実行"],"ko":["Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 PDF 문서를 읽기","PDF 문서에서 텍스트를 추출","PDF 양식을 채우기","명령줄 도구를 사용하여 PDF 처리 작업을 수행"],"es":["Lectura y escritura de PDF","Extracción de texto de PDF","Creación de PDF personalizados","Relleno de formularios PDF","Manipulación de páginas PDF"],"fr":["Lecture et écriture de PDF","Extraction de texte de PDF","Création de PDF personnalisés","Remplissage de formulaires PDF","Manipulation de pages PDF"],"de":["Lesen und Schreiben von PDF","Textextraktion aus PDF","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten PDF","Ausfüllen von PDF-Formularen","Manipulation von PDF-Seiten"],"pt":["Leitura de arquivos PDF","Extração de texto de arquivos PDF","Manipulação de páginas de arquivos PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python para processamento de PDF","Exemplos de código para processamento de PDF"],"ru":["Чтение файлов PDF","Извлечение текста из файлов PDF","Манипуляция страницами файлов PDF","Использование библиотек Python для обработки PDF","Примеры кода для обработки PDF"],"ar":["قراءة ملفات PDF","استخراج النص من ملفات PDF","التلاعب بصفحات ملفات PDF","استخدام مكتبات بايثون لمعالجة PDF","أمثلة من الكود لمعالجة PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF处理","Python库","命令行工具","PDF读取","PDF提取","PDF填写"],"ja":["PDF処理","Pythonライブラリ","コマンドラインツール","PDF読み取り","PDF抽出","PDF埋め"],"ko":["PDF 처리","Python 라이브러리","명령줄 도구","PDF 읽기","PDF 추출","PDF 채우기"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","bibliotecas pdf","herramientas de línea de comandos pdf","desarrollo de pdf","manipulación de pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","bibliothèques pdf","outils de ligne de commande pdf","développement de pdf","manipulation de pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","pdf-bibliotheken","kommandozeilen-tools pdf","pdf-entwicklung","pdf-manipulation"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","bibliotecas python para pdf","manipulação de arquivos pdf","leitura de arquivos pdf","extração de texto de pdf","desenvolvimento de aplicativos pdf"],"ru":["обработка pdf","библиотеки python для pdf","манипуляция файлами pdf","чтение файлов pdf","извлечение текста из pdf","разработка приложений pdf"],"ar":["معالجة بي دي إف","مكتبات بايثون لمعالجة بي دي إف","التلاعب بملفات بي دي إف","قراءة ملفات بي دي إف","استخراج النص من بي دي إف","تطوير تطبيقات بي دي إف"]}},"owner":"krishagel","repo":"geoffrey","repoPath":"krishagel/geoffrey","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.575Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"Comprehensive PDF manipulation toolkit for extracting text and tables, creating new PDFs, merging/splitting documents, and handling forms. When Claude needs to fill in a PDF form or programmatically process, generate, or analyze PDF documents at scale.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:38:20.829Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities using Python libraries like pypdf.","zh":"适合需要使用Python库（如pypdf）进行高级PDF处理的文档分析代理。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用した高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas utilizando bibliotecas de Python como pypdf.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités de traitement de PDF avancées utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfähigkeiten unter Verwendung von Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python como pypdf.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым требуются расширенные возможности обработки PDF с использованием библиотек Python, таких как pypdf.","ar":"يعد مثاليًا للوكلاء قائمين على تحليل المستندات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لمعالجة ملفات PDF باستخدام مكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text, read PDF documents, and perform essential PDF processing operations using command-line tools and Python libraries like pypdf, enabling advanced document analysis and automation capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理提取文本、读取PDF文档和使用命令行工具以及Python库（如pypdf）执行基本PDF处理操作的能力，从而实现高级文档分析和自动化功能。","ja":"エージェントにテキストを抽出してPDFドキュメントを読み取り、コマンドラインツールおよびPythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用して基本的なPDF処理操作を実行する機能を与え、高度なドキュメント分析および自動化機能を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트를 추출하고 PDF 문서를 읽어들이고 명령줄 도구 및 Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 기본 PDF 처리 작업을 수행할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 고급 문서 분석 및 자동화 기능을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto, leer documentos PDF y realizar operaciones de procesamiento de PDF esenciales utilizando herramientas de línea de comandos y bibliotecas de Python como pypdf, lo que permite capacidades de análisis y automatización de documentos avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte, de lire des documents PDF et d''effectuer des opérations de traitement de PDF essentielles en utilisant des outils de ligne de commande et des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf, permettant ainsi des capacités d''analyse et d''automatisation de documents avancées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Text zu extrahieren, PDF-Dokumente zu lesen und wesentliche PDF-Verarbeitungsvorgänge mithilfe von Befehlszeilentools und Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf durchzuführen, wodurch erweiterte Dokumentenanalyse- und Automatisierungsfähigkeiten ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto, ler documentos PDF e realizar operações de processamento de PDF essenciais usando ferramentas de linha de comando e bibliotecas Python como pypdf, permitindo capacidades avançadas de análise e automação de documentos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст, читать документы PDF и выполнять основные операции обработки PDF с использованием инструментов командной строки и библиотек Python, таких как pypdf, что обеспечивает расширенные возможности анализа и автоматизации документов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استخراج النص، قراءة مستندات PDF، وأداء عمليات معالجة PDF الأساسية باستخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر ومكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf، مما يتيح إمكانيات متقدمة لتحليل المستندات وأتمتتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from PDF documents","Automating PDF form filling using Python","Debugging PDF processing workflows"],"zh":["从PDF文档中提取文本","使用Python自动填充PDF表单","调试PDF处理工作流"],"ja":["PDFドキュメントからテキストを抽出する","Pythonを使用してPDFフォームを自動的に埋める","PDF処理ワークフローをデバッグする"],"ko":["PDF 문서에서 텍스트 추출하기","Python을 사용하여 PDF 양식을 자동으로 채우기","PDF 처리 워크플로를 디버깅하기"],"es":["Extracción de texto de documentos PDF","Automatización del llenado de formularios PDF utilizando Python","Depuración de flujos de trabajo de procesamiento de PDF"],"fr":["Extraction de texte à partir de documents PDF","Automatisation du remplissage de formulaires PDF à l''aide de Python","Débogage des flux de travail de traitement de PDF"],"de":["Extraktion von Text aus PDF-Dokumenten","Automatisierung der Ausfüllung von PDF-Formularen mit Python","Fehlerbehebung bei PDF-Verarbeitungsworkflows"],"pt":["Extração de texto de documentos PDF","Automatização do preenchimento de formulários PDF usando Python","Depuração de fluxos de trabalho de processamento de PDF"],"r