"pt":"O react-to-solid é um conjunto de regras de transformação para converter componentes React em SolidJS","ru":"React-to-Solid - это набор правил трансформации для преобразования компонентов React в SolidJS","ar":"React-to-Solid هو مجموعة من قواعد التحويل لتحويل مكونات React إلى SolidJS"},"features":{"en":["Provides reusable context for React-to-SolidJS transformations","Offers a single source of truth for transformation rules in the Zaidan project","Supports Shadcn UI and SolidJS technologies","Enables AI agents to reference transformation tables for accurate conversions","Includes critical rules for seamless React-to-SolidJS conversions"],"zh":["提供React组件到SolidJS的转换规则","支持Shadcn Registry for SolidJS","为其他转换代理提供必要的规则和映射","实现React和SolidJS之间的无缝转换","简化开发流程"],"ja":["ReactコンポーネントをSolidJSに変換するルールを提供","Shadcn Registry for SolidJSをサポート","他の変換エージェントに必要なルールとマッピングを提供","ReactとSolidJSの間のシームレスな変換を実現","開発プロセスを簡素化"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트를 SolidJS로 변환하는 규칙을 제공","Shadcn Registry for SolidJS를 지원","他の 변환 에이전트에 필요한 규칙과 매핑을 제공","React와 SolidJS의 사이의 無縫な 변환을 구현","개발 프로세스를 간소화"],"es":["Transformación de componentes React en SolidJS","Reglas y mapeos para la conversión de componentes","Compatibilidad con Shadcn UI y SolidJS","Fuente única de verdad para la transformación de componentes","Reutilización de contextos para la conversión de componentes"],"fr":["Conversion de composants React en SolidJS","Règles et mappages pour la conversion de composants","Compatibilité avec Shadcn UI et SolidJS","Source unique de vérité pour la conversion de composants","Réutilisation de contextes pour la conversion de composants"],"de":["Umwandlung von React-Komponenten in SolidJS","Regeln und Mappings für die Umwandlung von Komponenten","Kompatibilität mit Shadcn UI und SolidJS","Einzige Quelle der Wahrheit für die Umwandlung von Komponenten","Wiederverwendung von Kontexten für die Umwandlung von Komponenten"],"pt":["Regras de transformação personalizadas para converter componentes React em SolidJS","Integração com o Shadcn UI","Compatibilidade com o SolidJS","Fornecimento de um conjunto de regras de transformação para uso em outros agentes","Suporte à criação de aplicações personalizadas"],"ru":["Настройка правил трансформации для преобразования компонентов React в SolidJS","Интеграция с Shadcn UI","Совместимость с SolidJS","Предоставление набора правил трансформации для использования в других агентах","Поддержка создания настраиваемых приложений"],"ar":["قواعد التحويل المخصصة لتحويل مكونات React إلى SolidJS","التكامل مع واجهة المستخدم Shadcn","التوافق مع SolidJS","توفير مجموعة من قواعد التحويل للاستخدام في وكلاء آخرين","دعم إنشاء تطبيقات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use react-to-solid","react-to-solid transformation rules","react-to-solid vs Shadcn UI","react-to-solid install guide","what is react-to-solid","react-to-solid setup for AI agents","react-to-solid alternative for SolidJS","react-to-solid best practices","react-to-solid for Shadcn registry"],"zh":["React-to-Solid","Shadcn Registry for SolidJS","React组件转换","SolidJS开发","AI工具","前端开发","JavaScript开发"],"ja":["React-to-Solid","Shadcn Registry for SolidJS","Reactコンポーネント変換","SolidJS開発","AIエージェント","フロントエンド開発","JavaScript開発"],"ko":["React-to-Solid","Shadcn Registry for SolidJS","React 컴포넌트 변환","SolidJS 개발","AI 도구","프론트엔드 개발","JavaScript 개발"],"es":["React-to-Solid","transformación de componentes React","conversión de componentes React a SolidJS","Shadcn UI","SolidJS","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","herramientas de desarrollo","agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["React-to-Solid","conversion de composants React","migration de composants React vers SolidJS","Shadcn UI","SolidJS","développement d''applications web","outils de développement","agents d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["React-to-Solid","Umwandlung von React-Komponenten","Umstellung von React-Komponenten auf SolidJS","Shadcn UI","SolidJS","Webanwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Künstliche-Intelligenz-Tools"],"pt":["react-to-solid","transformação de componentes","SolidJS","Shadcn UI","desenvolvimento de aplicações","regras de transformação","componentes React","aplicações personalizadas"],"ru":["react-to-solid","преобразование компонентов","SolidJS","Shadcn UI","разработка приложений","правила трансформации","компоненты React","настраиваемые приложения"],"ar":["react-to-solid","تحويل المكونات","SolidJS","واجهة المستخدم Shadcn","تطوير التطبيقات","قواعد التحويل","مكونات React","تطبيقات مخصصة"]}},"owner":"carere","repo":"zaidan","repoPath":"carere/zaidan","stars":45,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T23:00:52Z","topics":["shadcn-ui","solidjs"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-to-solid","description":"Core transformation engine for React-to-SolidJS conversion. Contains React-to-SolidJS mapping tables, Base UI to Kobalte/Corvu mapping, and third-party dependency mapping. Provides transformation rules as reusable context.","bodyPreview":"# React-to-SolidJS Transformation Rules\n\nSingle source of truth for all React-to-SolidJS transformations in the Zaidan project. This is a KNOWLEDGE skill -- it provides transformation rules as reusable context. Agents reference these tables when converting React components to SolidJS equivalents.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: This skill is a **knowledge resource**. It does NOT perform transformations itself. Instead, it provides the necessary rules and mappings that other transformation agents will reference","body":"# React-to-SolidJS Transformation Rules\n\nSingle source of truth for all React-to-SolidJS transformations in the Zaidan project. This is a KNOWLEDGE skill -- it provides transformation rules as reusable context. Agents reference these tables when converting React components to SolidJS equivalents.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: This skill is a **knowledge resource**. It does NOT perform transformations itself. Instead, it provides the necessary rules and mappings that other transformation agents will reference when executing conversions. If user call it manually, explain what this skill covers and redirect user to the agents that will use this skill, then stop. \n\n## React-to-SolidJS Transformation Rules\n\n| Aspect | React (shadcn) | SolidJS (Zaidan) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Class attribute | `className` | `class` |\n| Class prop type | `className?: string` | `class?: string` |\n| Props destructuring | `{ className, ...props }` | `splitProps(props, [\"class\"])` |\n| Spread props | `{...props}` | `{...others}` after splitProps |\n| Default props | Destructure defaults `{ x = 5 }` | `mergeProps({ x: 5 }, props)` |\n| Conditional rendering | `{condition && <El />}` | `<Show when={condition}><El /></Show>` |\n| List rendering | `{items.map(x => ...)}` | `<For each={items}>{x => ...}</For>` |\n| Primitive library | `@base-ui/react-*` | `@kobalte/core/*` |\n| Polymorphic | `asChild` prop | `as` prop with `PolymorphicProps` |\n| Refs | `forwardRef` wrapper | Remove (not needed in SolidJS) |\n| Children type | `React.ReactNode` | `JSX.Element` |\n| Component type | `React.ComponentProps<\"div\">` | `ComponentProps<\"div\">` |\n| Event target | `e.target.value` | `e.currentTarget.value` |\n| Utils import | `@/registry/bases/base/lib/utils` | `@/lib/utils` |\n\n### Import Transformations\n\n```tsx\n// REMOVE (React):\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"base-ui\"\nimport * as DialogPrimitive from \"@base-ui/react/dialog\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/registry/bases/base/lib/utils\"\n\n// ADD (SolidJS):\nimport type { ComponentProps, JSX, ValidComponent } from \"solid-js\"\nimport { splitProps, mergeProps, Show, For } from \"solid-js\"\nimport * as DialogPrimitive from \"@kobalte/core/dialog\"\nimport type { PolymorphicProps } from \"@kobalte/core/polymorphic\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n```\n\n## Advanced Transformation Patterns\n\n### Component Part Patterns WITHOUT Kobalte/Corvu Primitive\n\nWhen a component part does NOT use a Kobalte or Corvu primitive, use this pattern:\n\n```tsx\ntype ComponentPartProps = ComponentProps<\"<html_element>\">\n\nconst ComponentPart = (props: ComponentPartProps) => {\n  const mergedProps = mergeProps({ aProp: \"default\" } as ComponentPartProps, props);\n  const [local, others] = splitProps(mergedProps, [\"aProp\"]);\n  return <html_element aProp={local.aProp} {...others} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Component Part Patterns WITH Kobalte/Corvu Primitive\n\nWhen a component part uses a Kobalte or Corvu primitive, use polymorphic typing:\n\n```tsx\nimport * as Primitive from \"@kobalte/core/primitive\";\n\ntype ComponentPartProps<T extends ValidComponent = \"<html_element>\"> =\n  PolymorphicProps<T, Primitive.PrimitivePartProps<T>> &\n  Pick<ComponentProps<\"<html_element>\">, \"aProp\">;\n\nconst ComponentPart = <T extends ValidComponent = \"<html_element>\">(\n  props: ComponentPartProps<T>\n) => {\n  const mergedProps = mergeProps(\n    { aProp: \"default\" } as ComponentPartProps<T>,\n    props as ComponentPartProps<T>\n  );\n  const [local, others] = splitProps(mergedProps, [\"aProp\"]);\n  return <Primitive.Root aProp={local.aProp} {...others} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Reading Kobalte Documentation\n\nWhen consulting Kobalte docs at `https://kobalte.dev/docs/core/components/<component-name>`:\n\n- **Anatomy Section**: Lists all `ComponentPart` elements and how to combine them\n- **Rendered Elements Section**: Check the \"Default rendered element\" column:\n  - If starts with a capital letter -> no primitive used (e.g., a Kobalte sub-component)\n  - If `none` -> no primitive used (wrapper/context provider)\n  - Otherwise -> native HTML element (e.g., `div`, `button`, `h3`)\n- **API Reference**: Props, data attributes, CSS variables for each part\n- **CSS Variables**: Kobalte prefixes with `--kb-` (e.g., `--kb-accordion-content-height`)\n\n### Reading Corvu Documentation\n\nWhen consulting Corvu docs at `https://corvu.dev/docs/primitives/<component-name>`:\n\n- **Anatomy Section**: Lists all `ComponentPart` elements with combination patterns\n- **API Reference Section**: Rendered elements are specified in the Props table, under the `as` row\n- **DynamicProps**: Corvu uses `DynamicProps` instead of Kobalte''s `PolymorphicProps`\n- **CSS Variables**: Corvu prefixes with `--corvu-` (e.g., `--corvu-disclosure-content-height`)\n- **Data Attributes**: Corvu prefixes with `data-corvu-` (e.g., `data-corvu-accordion-trigger`)\n- **Context Hooks**: `useContext()` and `useItemContext()` for accessing component state\n\n## Documentation Resources\n\n### Kobalte Core Components\n- **URL Pattern**: `https://kobalte.dev/docs/core/components/<component-name>`\n- **Content**: Anatomy, Rendered elements, API Reference, Props, Data Attributes, CSS Variables\n- For detailed patterns, see [docs/kobalte-patterns.md](docs/kobalte-patterns.md)\n\n### Corvu Primitives\n- **URL Pattern**: `https://corvu.dev/docs/primitives/<component-name>`\n- **Content**: Anatomy, API Reference with rendered elements in Props table\n- For detailed patterns, see [docs/corvu-patterns.md](docs/corvu-patterns.md)\n\n### Shadcn Registry\n- **Components**: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shadcn-ui/ui/refs/heads/main/apps/v4/registry/bases/base/ui/<component-name>.tsx`\n- **Examples**: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shadcn-ui/ui/refs/heads/main/apps/v4/registry/bases/base/examples/<component-name>-example.tsx`\n- **Docs**: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shadcn-ui/ui/refs/heads/main/apps/v4/content/docs/components/<component-name>.mdx`\n- **Schema**: `https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json`\n\n## Supporting Documentation\n\n- [docs/kobalte-patterns.md](docs/kobalte-patterns.md) -- Kobalte anatomy, rendered elements, props, data attributes, CSS variables\n- [docs/corvu-patterns.md](docs/corvu-patterns.md) -- Corvu anatomy, API patterns, DynamicProps, context hooks\n- [docs/base-ui-mapping.md](docs/base-ui-mapping.md) -- Complete Base UI to Kobalte/Corvu mapping reference\n- [docs/third-party-deps.md](docs/third-party-deps.md) -- Detailed third-party React-to-SolidJS dependency mapping\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:36:13.272Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents working with SolidJS and Shadcn UI, needing seamless React-to-SolidJS transformations.","zh":"适用于使用 SolidJS 和 Shadcn UI 的前端代理，需要无缝的 React 到 SolidJS 转换。","ja":"SolidJS と Shadcn UI を使用するフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。React から SolidJS への無шов転換が必要です。","ko":"SolidJS와 Shadcn UI를 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 무шов한 React에서 SolidJS로의 변환을 필요로합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que trabajan con SolidJS y Shadcn UI, y que necesitan transformaciones sin problemas de React a SolidJS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend travaillant avec SolidJS et Shadcn UI, nécessitant des transformations React-to-SolidJS sans accroc.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die mit SolidJS und Shadcn UI arbeiten und nahtlose React-to-SolidJS-Transformationen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que trabalham com SolidJS e Shadcn UI, necessitando de transformações sem problemas de React para SolidJS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов фронтенда, работающих с SolidJS и Shadcn UI, требующих бесшовных преобразований React в SolidJS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يعمل مع SolidJS و Shadcn UI ، ويحتاج إلى تحويلات senza مشاكل من React إلى SolidJS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage single-source transformation rules for converting React components to SolidJS equivalents, utilizing SolidJS and Shadcn UI libraries, and enabling efficient development workflows with reusable context.","zh":"赋予代理使用单源转换规则将 React 组件转换为 SolidJS 等效组件的能力，利用 SolidJS 和 Shadcn UI 库，并通过可重用上下文实现高效的开发工作流。","ja":"React コンポーネントを SolidJS の同等のコンポーネントに変換するための単一ソース変換ルールを使用するエージェントを可能にし、SolidJS と Shadcn UI ライブラリを利用し、再利用可能なコンテキストを使用して効率的な開発ワークフローを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 단일 소스 변환 규칙을 사용하여 React 컴포넌트를 SolidJS의 동일한 컴포넌트로 변환할 수 있도록하여, SolidJS와 Shadcn UI 라이브러리를 활용하고 재사용 가능한 컨텍스트를 통해 효율적인 개발 워크플ロー가 가능합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar reglas de transformación de una sola fuente para convertir componentes de React en equivalentes de SolidJS, utilizando las bibliotecas de SolidJS y Shadcn UI, y permitiendo flujos de desarrollo eficientes con contexto reutilizable.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti de règles de transformation à source unique pour convertir les composants React en équivalents SolidJS, en utilisant les bibliothèques SolidJS et Shadcn UI, et en permettant des flux de développement efficaces avec un contexte réutilisable.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, single-Quelle-Transformationsregeln für die Umwandlung von React-Komponenten in SolidJS-Äquivalente zu nutzen, unter Verwendung der SolidJS- und Shadcn-UI-Bibliotheken und ermöglicht effiziente Entwicklungsmethoden mit wiederverwendbarem Kontext.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem regras de transformação de origem única para converter componentes React em equivalentes SolidJS, utilizando bibliotecas SolidJS e Shadcn UI e habilitando fluxos de desenvolvimento eficientes com contexto reutilizável.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать однократные правила преобразования для преобразования компонентов React в эквивалентные SolidJS, используя библиотеки SolidJS и Shadcn UI и обеспечивающие эффективные рабочие процессы разработки с повторно используемым контекстом.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من الاستفادة من قواعد التحويل المصدر الواحدة لتحويل مكونات React إلى ما يعادلها من SolidJS ، باستخدام مكتبات SolidJS و Shadcn UI وتتمكن من تسهيل سير عمل التطوير الفعال مع السياق القابل لإعادة الاستخدام."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting React components to SolidJS for improved performance","Generating SolidJS equivalents for existing React applications","Referencing transformation rules for Zaidan project development"],"zh":["将 React 组件转换为 SolidJS 以提高性能","为现有的 React 应用程序生成 SolidJS 等效组件","为 Zaidan 项目开发引用转换规则"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの向上のために React コンポーネントを SolidJS に変換する","既存の React アプリケーションに SolidJS の同等のコンポーネントを生成する","Zaidan プロジェクト開発のために変換ルールを参照する"],"ko":["성능 개선을 위해 React 컴포넌트를 SolidJS로 변환하는 것","기존 React 애플리케이션에 SolidJS의 동일한 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","Zaidan 프로젝트 개발을 위해 변환 규칙을 참조하는 것"],"es":["Convertir componentes de React a SolidJS para mejorar el rendimiento","Generar equivalentes de SolidJS para aplicaciones de React existentes","Hacer referencia a reglas de transformación para el desarrollo del proyecto Zaidan"],"fr":["Convertir les composants React en SolidJS pour améliorer les performances","Générer des équivalents SolidJS pour les applications React existantes","Référencer les règles de transformation pour le développement du projet Zaidan"],"de":["React-Komponenten in SolidJS umwandeln, um die Leistung zu verbessern","SolidJS-Äquivalente für bestehende React-Anwendungen generieren","Verweis auf Transformationsregeln für die Entwicklung des Zaidan-Projekts"],"pt":["Converte componentes React para SolidJS para melhorar o desempenho","Gera equivalentes SolidJS para aplicações React existentes","Faz referência às regras de transformação para desenvolvimento do projeto Zaidan"],"ru":["Преобразует компоненты React в SolidJS для улучшения производительности","Генерирует эквивалентные SolidJS для существующих приложений React","Ссылается на правила преобразования для разработки проекта Zaidan"],"ar":["يتحول مكونات React إلى SolidJS لتحسين الأداء","ينشئ ما يعادل SolidJS لتطبيقات React الحالية","يشير إلى قواعد التحويل لتطوير مشروع Zaidan"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not perform transformations itself, requires referencing by other transformation agents","Specific to React-to-SolidJS transformations, limited to SolidJS and Shadcn UI ecosystems"],"zh":["不能自身执行转换，需要其他转换代理的引用","仅限于 React 到 SolidJS 的转换，仅限于 SolidJS 和 Shadcn UI 生态系统"],"ja":["自身で変換を実行できないため、他の変換エージェントからの参照が必要","React から SolidJS への変換のみに限定され、SolidJS と Shadcn UI のエコシステムのみに限定される"],"ko":["자체적으로 변환을 실행할 수 없으므로 다른 변환 에이전트의 참조가 필요함","React에서 SolidJS로의 변환만 가능하며, SolidJS와 Shadcn UI의 에코시스템에만 국한됨"],"es":["No realiza las transformaciones en sí mismo, requiere referencia por parte de otros agentes de transformación","Específico para transformaciones de React a SolidJS, limitado a los ecosistemas de SolidJS y Shadcn UI"],"fr":["Ne réalise pas les transformations lui-même, nécessite une référence par d''autres agents de transformation","Spécifique aux transformations React-to-SolidJS, limité aux écosystèmes SolidJS et Shadcn UI"],"de":["Führt keine Transformationen durch, erfordert Verweisung durch andere Transformationsagenten","Spezifisch für React-to-SolidJS-Transformationen, auf SolidJS- und Shadcn-UI-Ökosysteme beschränkt"],"pt":["Não realiza transformações por si mesmo, requer referência por outros agentes de transformação","Específico para transformações React para SolidJS, limitado aos ecossistemas SolidJS e Shadcn UI"],"ru":["Не выполняет преобразования самостоятельно, требует ссылки на другие агенты преобразования","Конкретно для преобразований React в SolidJS, ограничен экосистемами SolidJS и Shadcn UI"],"ar":["لا يؤدي التحويلات بنفسه ، يتطلب الإشارة من قبل وكلاء تحويل آخرين","محدد لتحويلات React إلى SolidJS ، مقيد بنطاقات SolidJS و Shadcn UI"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f83de1a085747c5244374214de4d9e76f11b34a535211cc5833259fbbc4bc12d","qualityScore":44}');
