INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('carrotwaxr/peek-stash-browser/release-workflow', 'release-workflow', 'carrotwaxr', 'peek-stash-browser', 'community', 'release-workflow carrotwaxr peek-stash-browser community The release-workflow skill automates deployment for media browser apps, utilizing GitHub Actions and Docker Hub. It benefits developers by simplifying the release process. release-workflow 是一个自动化发布流程，使用 GitHub Actions 和 Docker Hub 实现版本管理和发布 release-workflow は GitHub Actions と Docker Hub を使用してバージョン管理と公開を自動化するツールです release-workflow는 GitHub Actions와 Docker Hub를 사용하여 버전 관리와 배포를 자동화하는 도구입니다 Release-workflow es una herramienta que automatiza la creación y publicación de imágenes Docker mediante GitHub Actions Release-workflow est un outil qui automatise la création et la publication d''images Docker via GitHub Actions Release-workflow ist ein Tool, das die Erstellung und Veröffentlichung von Docker-Images mittels GitHub Actions automatisiert O release-workflow é um fluxo de trabalho que automatiza o lançamento do aplicativo, incluindo validação pré-lançamento e publicação de imagens Docker. Release-workflow - это рабочий процесс, который автоматизирует выпуск приложения, включая предварительную проверку и публикацию образов Docker. release-workflow هو تدفق عمل يتلقيم إصدار التطبيق، بما في ذلك التحقق المسبق للإصدار ونشر صور Docker. release-workflow setup guide automated deployment with GitHub Actions Docker Hub publishing tutorial what is release-workflow release-workflow alternative how to use release-workflow with Docker release-workflow vs manual deployment release-workflow install media browser app deployment automation release-workflow 自动化发布流程 GitHub Actions Docker Hub 版本管理 软件发布 AI工具 自动化部署 Triggers releases by pushing git tags Automates Docker image builds and publishing via GitHub Actions Supports stable and beta version schemes (X.Y.Z and X.Y.Z-beta.N) Requires identical versions in client/package.json and server/package.json Uses a specific tag format (vX.Y.Z or vX.Y.Z-beta.N) release-workflow is a media browser app deployment automation tool using GitHub Actions and Docker Hub, triggered by git tags.');
